{
  "description": "The creature is shown in right-facing profile against a plain off-white background, standing on a flat surface with a slight shadow beneath its feet. It has an elongated, low-slung quadrupedal body with a strongly arched back. The dorsal surface from the back of the neck to the partially cropped posterior is covered in overlapping, rounded, dark brown keratinous scales with lighter tan edges. The ventral and lateral surfaces, including the head, neck, sides, belly, legs and underside of the tail, are pale pink, smooth but deeply wrinkled with transverse folds along the belly and limbs. The head at the anterior right is broad, flat-snouted and pale pink with small dark eyes with light irises on the sides, tiny nostrils at the tip of the snout, and a faint closed mouth. Behind the head on both sides of the neck are feathery external gills. The four stout limbs support the body, each ending in a five-toed foot with small pale claws. The tail extends to the left out of the frame, scaled above and pink below.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "broad, flat-snouted, pale pink with smooth slightly glossy skin, small dark round eyes with pale blue-grey irises on the sides, two tiny nostril openings at the snout tip, and a faint horizontal mouth line",
      "where": "at the anterior right end of the body, facing right"
    },
    {
      "part": "gills",
      "looks_like": "six feathery external gills, three on each side of the neck, pinkish-red with a central stalk and many fine filamentous branches giving a fern-like appearance",
      "where": "protruding outward from behind the head at the junction of head and scaled back, three visible on the near right side and three on the far left side"
    },
    {
      "part": "scales",
      "looks_like": "overlapping, rounded, plate-like keratinous scales, dark brown in the center with lighter tan-brown edges and fine radial texture, arranged in diagonal rows",
      "where": "covering the entire dorsal surface from just behind the gills over the arched back to the dorsal side of the tail"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick, stout, deeply wrinkled pale pink limbs with loose folded skin, muscular upper portions tapering to the feet",
      "where": "two forelegs under the chest and two hindlegs under the mid-body, all supporting the body on the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "pale pink, five-toed with splayed digits each tipped with a small short pale tan claw, wrinkled skin on the dorsal surface",
      "where": "at the distal end of each of the four legs, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "partially visible, dorsal side covered with the same dark brown overlapping scales, ventral side pale pink wrinkled skin, tapering",
      "where": "at the posterior left end of the body, extending out of the left edge of the image"
    }
  ],
